      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been dealing with this really bad gnawing pain in my upper stomach for a few weeks now. it feels like constant indigestion or gastritis. i've been taking omeprazole every morning to try and settle it down, but it's still bothering me. i just developed a really painful toothache too... is it safe to take some ibuprofen for the tooth pain even though my stomach has been acting up like this?",
